00:58:16.420 --> 00:58:24.410
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia, who came by our office this morning with doughnuts-- yes, doughnuts-- and a warning.

00:58:24.410 --> 00:58:29.210
<v Chris Tenove>Please don't expect every white person who comes to do this.

00:58:29.210 --> 00:58:33.720
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:58:33.720 --> 00:58:55.870
<v Woman>Is that that show by those hipster know-it-alls who talk about how fascinating ordinary people are? [SIGH] God.

